Package: usefulfunctions
Title: Reusable Helpers for Single-Cell, Bulk RNA-Seq and Cancer Genomics
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Dillon", "Corvino", , "48763022+Eomesodermin@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0683-1369"))
Description: Helper functions for immunology and cancer-genomics analyses: colour
    palettes, differential-expression volcano plots, heatmaps and dendrograms,
    mouse-human gene-symbol conversion, Gene Ontology over-representation,
    TCGA overall-survival analysis stratified by gene or signature expression, and
    single-cell (Seurat) helpers such as UMAP hyper-parameter sweeps and gene-gene
    correlation. Heavy Bioconductor dependencies are optional (Suggests) so the
    package installs quickly; each function checks for what it needs at call time.
